HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: VELOCITY OBSTACLE GEOMETRY AND EVASION CONES
BTW Computes collision cones and evasive velocity vectors
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A TIME_HORIZON_SEC ITZ 900.0

HOW IZ I CHECK_VO_CONE YR DX AN YR DY AN YR DVX AN YR DVY
    I HAS A CPA ITZ I IZ CPA_COMPUTE YR DX AN YR DY AN YR DVX AN YR DVY MKAY
    I HAS A TCPA ITZ I IZ TCPA_COMPUTE YR DX AN YR DY AN YR DVX AN YR DVY MKAY
    I HAS A CONFLICT ITZ BOTH SAEM SMALLR OF CPA AN 0.8 AN CPA
    FOUND YR CONFLICT
IF U SAY SO

